From: C545D investigation <no-reply@example.invalid>
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] gio: opt-in static Win32 AppInfo cache for leak isolation

Target: GLib 2.82.4 gio/gwin32appinfo.c
NOT a production fix. An opt-in control for isolated Windows CI only.
No-op unless C545D_GIO_APPINFO_STATIC=1 is explicitly set before process startup.
With the env set, Windows program association changes will NOT refresh AppInfo.

--- a/gio/gwin32appinfo.c
+++ b/gio/gwin32appinfo.c
@@ -3861,5 +3861,13 @@ keys_updated (GWin32RegistryKey  *key,
               gpointer            user_data)
 {
+  /*
+   * C545D-only isolated test control: keep the initial AppInfo snapshot,
+   * but do not rebuild it on later registry notifications.
+   * NOT appropriate as a general-purpose GLib feature or production fix.
+   */
+  if (g_strcmp0 (g_getenv ("C545D_GIO_APPINFO_STATIC"), "1") == 0)
+    return;
+
   watch_keys ();
   /* Indicate the tree as not up-to-date, push a new job for the AppInfo thread */
   g_atomic_int_inc (&gio_win32_appinfo_update_counter);
